  <name>System Monitor</name>
  <summary>Task Manager and Performance Monitor</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      System Monitor is a native Linux performance and task monitoring application built with Rust and Slint.
      It features real-time monitoring of CPU per-core usage, system memory, swap, per-process bandwidth via NetHogs,
      disk I/O throughput, mounted filesystem storage capacity, and process tree inspect/terminate controls.
    </p>
  </description>
